flowchart LR
V[Visitor] --> SSR[React Router SSR + Express]
O[Owner] --> SSR
SSR --> PUB[Published-only Query Facade]
SSR --> GUARD[Owner Guard]
GUARD --> POLICY[Central Session / CSRF Policy]
GUARD --> COMMAND[Application Commands]
PUB --> REPO[Repository Ports]
COMMAND --> DOMAIN[Domain Modules]
COMMAND --> PUBLISH[Publishing and Revisions]
PUBLISH --> UOW[Postgres UnitOfWork]
PUBLISH --> OUT[Durable Outbox]
OUT --> CACHE[Cache/Sitemap Adapter]
OUT --> MAIL[Email Adapter]
REPO --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
UOW --> DB
